{% extends "lab-base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Evidence dossier · {{ story.label }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<header class="lab-header"><a class="back-link" href="../investigations/{{ story.slug }}.html">← Back to investigation</a><p class="eyebrow">Evidence dossier / {{ manifest.experiment_id }}</p><h1>{{ story.label }}<br><span class="title-muted">The record behind it.</span></h1><p class="lead">{{ story.conclusion }}</p><div class="action-row"><a class="button-link button-primary" href="../downloads/{{ manifest.run_id }}.zip" download>Download evidence bundle ↓</a><a class="button-link" href="../runs/{{ manifest.run_id }}/manifest.json">Original manifest</a></div></header>
<section class="section-block"><div class="section-heading"><h2>What has actually been checked</h2><p>Separate assessments keep missing evidence visible. No combined confidence percentage is assigned.</p></div><div class="check-grid">{% for name, status, note in story.checks %}<article class="check-card"><p class="eyebrow">{{ name }}</p><h3>{{ status }}</h3><p>{{ note }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Chain of evidence</h2><div class="provenance-chain"><div><small>01 / Input</small><strong>{{ manifest.inputs|length }} source reference{{ 's' if manifest.inputs|length != 1 else '' }}</strong><span>Archive or generated control</span></div><div><small>02 / Processing</small><strong>{{ manifest.experiment_id }}</strong><span>Code {{ manifest.git_sha }}</span></div><div><small>03 / Output</small><strong>{{ manifest.outcome }}</strong><span>{{ manifest.finished_at.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M UTC') }}</span></div></div>
<p class="figure-note">Run identifier: <code>{{ manifest.run_id }}</code>. The code reference is the one recorded by the experiment, not the current website build.</p>
{% if preparation %}<p class="callout-note">The interactive view has its own <a href="../runs/{{ preparation.run_id }}/manifest.json">preparation record</a>. It transforms the complete table and may fetch reduced waterfall previews. It adds no search exposure and does not rerun the detector.</p>{% endif %}
</section>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Source material</h2><p class="figure-note">Radio-input hashes identify the local frequency slices described in the notes. They are not checksums of the complete remote archive files.</p><div class="source-list">{% for item in manifest.inputs %}<details><summary>Input {{ loop.index }} · {{ item.uri.split('/')[-1] }}</summary><p>{% if item.uri.startswith('https://') %}<a href="{{ item.uri }}">Open original source ↗</a>{% endif %}</p><code>{{ item.uri }}</code><p>SHA-256: <code>{{ item.sha256 or 'Not recorded' }}</code></p><p>Recorded size: {{ item.size_bytes if item.size_bytes is not none else 'Not recorded' }} bytes</p></details>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Outputs you can inspect</h2><div class="artifact-list">{% for item in manifest.outputs %}<details><summary><a href="../{{ item.path }}">{{ item.path.split('/')[-1] }}</a>{% if item.size_bytes is not none %}<span>{{ '{:,}'.format(item.size_bytes) }} bytes</span>{% endif %}</summary><p>SHA-256: <code>{{ item.sha256 or 'Manifest is the checksum index; it does not hash itself.' }}</code></p></details>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Reproduce the recorded processing</h2><p>Use the <a href="https://github.com/mpetyx/theoxenia/blob/main/README.md">project installation guide</a> and the code revision recorded above. Source access and optional scientific dependencies are required. The website itself does not execute this command.</p><pre class="command-block"><code>{{ manifest.command }}</code></pre></section>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Original run notes</h2><ul class="run-notes">{% for note in manifest.notes %}<li>{{ note }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>
<section class="callout-note"><strong>External status: not submitted or independently accepted.</strong><p>This dossier makes our processing inspectable. A publication, DOI, or external review will be linked only after it exists. <a href="../research.html">How the work can contribute →</a></p></section>
{% endblock %}
